<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41018" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστήμη</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσταμαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>acquaintance with</i> a matter,
			<i>understanding</i>, <i>skill</i>, as in archery, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1057
			</span></i>; in war, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.121
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.72
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.62
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. πρὸς τὸν πόλεμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					33.7
				</span></i>
			 (fort. leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> περὶ τὰ μαθήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phlb.</u>
					55d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ νεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					511c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστήμῃ</span>
			<i>skilfully</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ μὴ ἐ. τοὺς
				ἐπαίνους</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιούμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					5.5.13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
				<i>professional skill</i>: hence, <i>profession</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ τὴν ἰατρικὴν ἐ. μεταχειριζόμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PFay.</u>
					106.22
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωγράφος</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἐ</span>. painter <i>by profession,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				896.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. generally, <i>knowledge</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστήμῃ σύ μου προὔχοις ἄν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					1115
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντ᾽</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστήμης πλέως</span> full <i>of
				knowledge</i> in all things, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				721
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tr.</u>
				338
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῆς ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				522.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. δοξαστική</span>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλήθεια</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				233c
			</span></i>: pl., <i>kinds of knowledge</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυρίαι ἀνδρῶν ἐπιστᾶμαι πέλονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					9.38
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				208a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
				<i>scientific knowledge, science</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόξα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				477b
			</span></i> sq., <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Lex</u>
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				301b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>AP</u>
				0.88b30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EN</u>
				1139b18
			</span></i>: coupled with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπειρία</span> and
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				422c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ion</u>
				536c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				981a2
			</span></i>: pl., <i>the sciences</i>, freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i>(<i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				522c
			</span></i>,al.), etc.</div>
